[00:00.67]1. Lovingly Jehovah
[00:01.72]Made provision through his Son
[00:06.32]For our sins to be forgiven
[00:10.92]And for death to be undone.
[00:15.52]If we truly are repentant,
[00:21.98]His forgiveness we can claim
[00:27.42]On the basis of Christ’s ransom,
[00:32.86]Asking pardon in his name.
[00:37.86]2. We receive such mercy
[00:47.80]When we act like God above
[00:57.80]And forgive each other freely,
[01:03.30]Showing empathy and love.
[01:09.12]Putting up with one another,
[01:14.50]Putting hurtfulness away;
[01:20.00]Showing honor to our brother,
[01:25.50]Showing love’s surpassing way.
[01:35.71]3. Mercy is a virtue
[01:40.71]That we all should cultivate.
[01:45.71]It will keep us from resentment,
[01:51.55]From the bitterness of hate.
[01:57.47]When we imitate Jehovah,
[02:01.74]Who is unsurpassed in love,
[02:06.19]We will truly be forgiving;
[02:23.52]We will be like God above.